# Tools CI installs outside the project's own dependencies. requirements-ci.txt is made from this with
# pip-compile (CONTRIBUTING.md, "Dependencies"), pinned with hashes like the project's own locks, so a run means
# the same thing twice and a new release of one of the tools' own dependencies can't slip into CI. Dependabot
# keeps both current (.github/dependabot.yml).
pip-audit==2.10.1
